<view class="page compose-page"><view class="page-title">分享新鲜事</view><view class="subtitle">照片、短视频或一个问题，都能开启交流。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在准备分享…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="btn btn-secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button></view><view wx:elif="{{circles.length === 0}}" class="empty"><view class="empty-symbol">🌱</view><view class="empty-title">先找到你的小圈子</view><view class="muted">加入感兴趣的圈子后，就能分享日常。暂时没养宠也欢迎。</view><button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="explore">去看看小圈子</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}" class="demo-label">本机体验 · 分享仅保存在当前设备</view><view wx:if="{{draftError}}" class="draft-error">{{draftError}}<button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="saveDraft">重试保存草稿</button></view><view class="editor card"><view wx:if="{{mediaConflict}}" class="attachment-conflict">草稿里同时保留了照片和视频。每条分享只能选择一种，请移除照片或视频后再发布；正文会保留。</view><view wx:if="{{video}}" class="video-draft"><video wx:if="{{videoPreviewSource}}" id="draft-video" src="{{videoPreviewSource}}" controls="true" autoplay="false" object-fit="contain"/><view wx:else class="upload-status-copy">本机视频预览暂不可用，可移除后重新选择</view><view class="row between"><text class="video-draft-note">已选择视频 · {{video.durationSeconds}} 秒</text><button class="remove-video" bindtap="removeVideo" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">移除视频</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{images.length || !hasVideoAttachment}}" class="image-grid"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="image-tile {{coverIndex === index ? 'cover-selected' : ''}}"><image wx:if="{{imagePreviewSources[index]}}" src="{{imagePreviewSources[index]}}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" data-index="{{index}}"/><view wx:else class="upload-status-copy">本机照片预览暂不可用，可移除后重新选择</view><button class="remove-image" catchtap="removeImage" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy}}">×</button><button class="set-cover" catchtap="chooseCover" data-index="{{index}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{coverIndex === index ? '✓ 封面' : '设为封面'}}</button></view><button wx:if="{{!hasVideoAttachment && attachmentCount < 3}}" class="upload-tile" bindtap="upload" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}"><text class="upload-plus">＋</text><text>添加照片</text></button><button wx:if="{{attachmentCount === 0}}" class="upload-tile video-upload-tile" bindtap="uploadVideo" loading="{{videoUploading}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}"><text class="upload-plus">▷</text><text>添加视频</text></button></view><view wx:if="{{videoUploading}}" class="video-progress">{{videoProgress === null ? '正在处理视频，请稍候…' : '视频上传中 · ' + videoProgress + '%'}}</view><view wx:if="{{pendingUploads.length || failedUploads.length}}" class="upload-status-list"><view wx:for="{{pendingUploads}}" wx:key="ticketId" class="upload-status"><view><view class="upload-status-title">◷ 等待{{item.mediaType === 'video' ? '视频' : '图片'}}处理</view><view class="upload-status-copy">{{item.message}}</view></view><button class="upload-remove" bindtap="removeUpload" data-id="{{item.ticketId}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">移除</button></view><view wx:for="{{failedUploads}}" wx:key="ticketId" class="upload-status failed"><view><view class="upload-status-title">{{item.mediaType === 'video' ? '视频' : '图片'}}处理未完成</view><view class="upload-status-copy">{{item.message}}</view></view><button class="upload-remove" bindtap="removeUpload" data-id="{{item.ticketId}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">移除</button></view><button class="btn btn-secondary check-uploads" bindtap="retryUploads" loading="{{uploadsBusy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">重新检查与重试</button><view class="upload-status-copy">{{mode === 'demo' ? '本机演示仅保存附件，不进行真实内容审核。无法恢复的附件请移除后重选。' : '审核通过后才能发布；未通过或已过期的附件请移除后重选。'}}</view></view><view wx:elif="{{uploadsBusy}}" class="upload-status-copy">正在恢复所选附件的处理状态…</view><view class="photo-note">照片或视频选填 · 最多 3 张照片，或 1 段 60 秒内、20 MB 内的视频</view><input class="title-input" value="{{title}}" bindinput="inputTitle" maxlength="40" placeholder="给这份分享起个标题（选填）" disabled="{{busy}}"/><textarea class="post-input" value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" placeholder="写一点正文，或分享照片、视频。今天有什么想和同好说的？" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view class="counter">{{text.length}} / 1000</view></view><view class="posting-options card"><picker range="{{visibilityChoices}}" range-key="name" value="{{visibilityIndex}}" bindchange="chooseVisibility" disabled="{{busy}}" aria-label="可见范围，当前{{visibilityChoices[visibilityIndex].name}}"><view class="visibility-option"><view><view class="label">可见范围</view><view class="visibility-hint">{{visibilityChoices[visibilityIndex].hint}}</view></view><view class="visibility-value"><text>{{visibilityChoices[visibilityIndex].name}}</text><text class="visibility-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></text></view></view></picker><view class="label">有哪些动物 <text class="option-hint">选填 · 最多 3 种</text></view><view class="topic-options animal-options"><view wx:for="{{animalChoices}}" wx:key="id" class="compose-topic {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectAnimal" data-id="{{item.id}}">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="animal-note">标注后，同好可以找到想看的内容，也能避开不想看到的种类。</view><button class="topic-toggle" bindtap="toggleTopics">聊点什么 <text class="option-hint">选填{{selectedTopics.length ? ' · 已选 ' + selectedTopics.length + ' 个' : ''}}</text><text>{{topicsOpen ? '⌃' : '⌄'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{topicsOpen}}" class="topic-options"><view wx:for="{{topicChoices}}" wx:key="name" class="compose-topic {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" bindtap="selectTopic" data-topic="{{item.name}}"># {{item.name}}</view></view><view class="label option-label">所属圈子</view><picker range="{{circles}}" range-key="name" value="{{circleIndex}}" bindchange="chooseCircle" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="circle-picker row between"><text>✳ {{circles[circleIndex].name}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker><view class="label option-label">关联公开地点 <text class="option-hint">选填</text></view><picker range="{{places}}" range-key="title" value="{{placeIndex}}" bindchange="choosePlace" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="circle-picker row between"><text>{{places[placeIndex].title}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker><view class="event-hint">只关联公共场所。距离按读者自己选定的参照计算，不会发布你的个人位置。</view><view wx:if="{{selectedPlaceId && !placeIndex}}" class="event-error">草稿中的地点尚未读取或已下架，请重试或重新选择。</view><view wx:if="{{selectedVisitId}}" class="row between"><text class="event-hint">已关联本人的到访记录，私人备注不会公开。</text><button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="clearVisit">取消到访关联</button></view><view wx:if="{{pendingPlaceId}}" class="event-error">已保留原草稿的地点。<button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="applyRequestedPlace">改用刚才选择的地点</button></view><button wx:if="{{placesError || placesBusy}}" class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="loadPlaces" loading="{{placesBusy}}" disabled="{{placesBusy}}">{{placesError || '正在读取地点'}}</button><view class="label option-label">关联附近活动 <text class="option-hint">选填</text></view><picker range="{{events}}" range-key="pickerLabel" value="{{eventIndex}}" bindchange="chooseEvent" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="circle-picker event-picker row between"><text>{{events[eventIndex].pickerLabel}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></picker><view wx:if="{{selectedEventId && !eventIndex}}" class="event-error">草稿关联的活动尚未读到，请继续查找或重新选择活动。</view><view class="event-hint">读到分享的人，可以从这里查看活动并报名。</view><view wx:if="{{eventError}}" class="event-error">{{eventError}}</view><button wx:if="{{eventsBusy || eventError || eventCursor}}" class="btn btn-ghost event-more" bindtap="loadEvents" loading="{{eventsBusy}}" disabled="{{eventsBusy}}">{{eventError ? '重新读取活动' : '继续查找可选活动'}}</button></view><view class="posting-note">🌿 真实、友善地分享。公开内容请勿包含住址、门牌或联系方式。</view><view wx:if="{{submitError}}" class="submit-error">{{submitError}}<button wx:if="{{pendingUploads.length || failedUploads.length}}" class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="retryUploads" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">重试附件处理</button></view><button class="btn btn-primary publish-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy || mediaConflict || pendingUploads.length || failedUploads.length}}">发布分享</button><view class="after-note">未发布的草稿仅保存在这台设备。发布后可在详情中修改可见范围或删除。</view><button class="btn btn-ghost clear-draft" bindtap="clearDraft" disabled="{{busy || uploadsBusy}}">清除本机草稿</button></block></view>
